    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2>Each time you delve into the ruins, the enemies and items are different in this RPG.<br>Defeat each area's boss to move onto the next!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Auto-battle system (progress automatically through battles &amp; the map)<br></li><li>Adjustable difficulty level<br></li><li>Adjustable player level</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2>Luna, a cute, furry adventurer, is on a journey around the world and has accidentally strayed into a deserted world full of terrible creatures.<br>Here, there are evil people and monsters everywhere who will attack, beat and suck the blood from outsiders....<br>Can she escape before it's too late...?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2>Each time you delve into the ruins, the enemies and items are different in this RPG.<br>Defeat each area's boss to move onto the next!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Auto-battle system (progress automatically through battles &amp; the map)<br></li><li>Adjustable difficulty level<br></li><li>Adjustable player level</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2>Luna, a cute, furry adventurer, is on a journey around the world and has accidentally strayed into a deserted world full of terrible creatures.<br>Here, there are evil people and monsters everywhere who will attack, beat and suck the blood from outsiders....<br>Can she escape before it's too late...?",
